{"id":"environnement","lemma":"environnement","pos":"noun","rank":2397,"glosses":["environment","nature"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.vi.ʁɔn.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/Fr-environnement.ogg/Fr-environnement.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"environnements"},"formAudio":{"environnements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/25/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-environnements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous devons essayer de protéger notre environnement.","en":"We must try to protect the environment.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to test, to try on"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to protect"},{"g":"our"},null]},{"text":"L'environnement doit être protégé.","en":"The environment must be protected.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"protected"}]},{"text":"Nous sommes influencés par notre environnement.","en":"We're influenced by our environment.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"influenced","l":"influencé"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"our"},null]},{"text":"Nos vies sont déterminées par notre environnement.","en":"Our lives are determined by our environment.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"notre"},{"g":"life","l":"vie"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"determined, resolute,","l":"déterminé"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"our"},null]},{"text":"Nous devons créer un environnement sécurisé pour nos enfants.","en":"We must create a safe environment for our children.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to create"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"protected"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"our","l":"notre"},{"g":"child","l":"enfant"}]}]}